Major Modifications in LinguaKey v2.0.0:
- Rebranded package structure (`com.linguakey.keyboard`) and Premium Minimal Dark/Purple visual identity.
- Added `LiveTranslationEngine.kt` for real-time single-field in-place translation inside any host app via `InputConnection`.
- Added `LinguaKeySmartBarController.kt` providing a live translation control bar, Syrian/Levantine dialect awareness (`SYRIAN_NATURAL`), alternative phrasings strip, grammar polish, and 1-tap original text restoration.
- Added `LinguaKeySecurityManager.kt` for hardware-backed `AndroidKeyStore` AES-256-GCM encryption of the Gemini API Key.

